        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greeley%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town hosts some of America’s oldest camps, including Pine Forest Camp, one of the first summer camps in the United States.",
